    {
      "key": "Cloth hangs from a spinning carousel. ",
      "order": 1,
      "act": "Act I",
      "truth": "Cloth hangs from a spinning carousel. Soft mushroom bodies dangle from arms, swinging outward as the ride turns — then slamming into obstacles. Walk through the straps. Feel them part around you.",
